{
  "dom_id": "step-q223949",
  "name": "Question 19",
  "problem": "The reciprocal of $1\\,\\frac{4}{7}$ is{{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "First, we convert the given mixed number to an improper fraction:\n\n$$\n1\\,\\frac{4}{7}=\\frac{(1\\times 7)+4}{7}=\\frac{11}{7}\n$$\n\nTo find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{11}{7}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{7}{11}\n$$\n\nSo, the reciprocal of $1\\frac{4}{7}$ is $\\frac{7}{11}.$",
